  "Archive metadata: tar members carry a single mtime 1789352170 (2026-09-14T02:16:10Z), uid/gid 501/20, mode 0600, directories 0755; manifest written 2026-09-14T02:17:14Z; attempt directory mode 0755 versus archive directory 0700. Reported, no action.",
